<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan tourism up 6.3 percent in first five months.</title>
<headline>Moroccan tourism up 6.3 percent in first five months.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of foreign tourists arriving in Morocco rose to 665,509 in the first five months of this year from 626,317 in the same period last year, the tourism ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry, in a statement carried by the Moroccan news agency MAP on Wednesday, said the numbers of French, Spanish, Italian and American tourists had increased while those of German and English visitors had fallen.</p>
</text>
